  "y": 1231.359375,
  "w": 143.328125,
  "h": 46,
  "text": "Measuring the impact of ChatGPT Ads"
 },
 {
  "tag": "LI",
  "x": 32,
  "y": 1277.359375,
  "w": 143.328125,
  "h": 61,
  "text": "Building confidence in alignment with our Ads Principles"
 },
 {
  "tag": "LI",
  "x": 32,
  "y": 1338.359375,
  "w": 143.328125,
  "h": 46,
  "text": "Expanding the features of ChatGPT Ads"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 1185.359375,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 84,
  "text": "We’re introducing a new visual ad format in ChatGPT, expanding our measurement tools and partnerships, and developing new ways to understand brand suitability."
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 1293.359375,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 224,
  "text": "ChatGPT reaches 1.2 billion people each week, making it the world’s largest AI-native consumer platform. Advertising helps us bring the benefits of AI to more p"
 },
 {
  "tag": "H2",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 1581.359375,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 37.078125,
  "text": "Bringing products and services to life"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 1642.4375,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 168,
  "text": "Our new visual ad format helps people imagine how products and services could fit into their lives. Through images showing product inspiration, product usage, o"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 1834.4375,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 112,
  "text": "Initially, we’ll test this new ad format during image generation in ChatGPT. Ads will be clearly labeled, and remain separate from the image being created. As w"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 1970.4375,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 56,
  "text": "Testing will begin later this month in the US with an initial group of advertisers."
 },
 {
  "tag": "H2",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 2090.4375,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 37.078125,
  "text": "Measuring the impact of ChatGPT Ads"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 2151.515625,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 140,
  "text": "Our measurement philosophy for ChatGPT Ads is focused on supporting both in-house and partner-led measurement solutions. Today, we’re expanding our measurement "
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 2315.515625,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 84,
  "text": "Integrations with Hightouch, Tealium, and LiveRamp make it easier for advertisers to send conversion data from their existing systems to ChatGPT Ads."
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 2423.515625,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 196,
  "text": "We now support leading attribution partners across the web and app space, enabling Conversions API, reporting, and click attribution solutions with companies in"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 2643.515625,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 168,
  "text": "Incrementality measurement plays an important role in building a fuller understanding of advertising’s business impact. While our work on incrementality is stil"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 2835.515625,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 224,
  "text": "Early partner findings illustrate strong performance across different measurement approaches. According to DV Rockerbox, WeightWatchers’ attributed cost per acq"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 3083.515625,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 56,
  "text": "Read more about these measurement tools and partnerships on our Ads Blog here⁠\n(opens in a new window)\n."
 },
 {
  "tag": "H2",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 3203.515625,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 74.15625,
  "text": "Building confidence in alignment with our Ads Principles"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 3301.671875,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 196,
  "text": "Confidence in advertising also depends on understanding the environment where ads can appear. OpenAI’s advertising policies and guardrails are designed to prote"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 3521.671875,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 140,
  "text": "Automated review, human oversight, and ongoing monitoring help us identify and address policy violations and improve our safeguards over time. For narrow placem"
 },
 {
  "tag": "P",
  "x": 294.984375,
  "y": 3685.671875,
  "w": 510,
  "h": 224,
  "text": "We’re also developing brand suitability evaluation pilots with DoubleVerify (DV) and Integral Ad Science (IAS) to help advertisers build a better understanding "
 },
 {
